{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0020_0010", "id": null, "offset": 96, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "今朔方之地.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0020_0030", "id": null, "offset": 48, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "今范陽郡. 涿, 竹角反.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0020_0040", "id": null, "offset": 35, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "逐吐谷渾得其地, 並在今酒泉·張掖·晉昌郡之北. 今悉爲北狄之地. 鄯音善. 且, 子餘反.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0020_0050", "id": null, "offset": 70, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "高麗所都.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0030_0010", "id": null, "offset": 27, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "纑, 紵屬, 可以爲布. 旄, 罽之屬. 纑音盧.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0030_0010", "id": null, "offset": 61, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "音蓮, 鈆之未鍊者.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0030_0010", "id": null, "offset": 263, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "符, 謂合於道也", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0040_0010", "id": null, "offset": 5, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "漢 元封三年(B.C.108).", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0050_0010", "id": null, "offset": 54, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "麟德元年, 改雲中都護爲單于都護.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0050_0010", "id": null, "offset": 62, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "掌所統諸蕃慰撫·征討·斥堠, 安輯蕃人及諸賞罰, 敍錄勳功, 總判府事.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0050_0010", "id": null, "offset": 69, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "掌貳都護事. 其安北單于則置一人.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0050_0010", "id": null, "offset": 79, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "錄事·功曹·倉曹·戶曹·兵曹·法曹參軍各一人, 參軍事三人. 其安北單于唯有司馬·倉曹·兵曹各一人, 餘並不置.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0060_0010", "id": null, "offset": 37, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "在東夷中, 遙祀.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0080_0010", "id": null, "offset": 19, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "歲時祓除, 如今三月上巳, 如水上之類. 釁浴謂以香薰草藥沐浴之.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0080_0010", "id": null, "offset": 34, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "蔡邕 章句曰:「陽氣和暖, 鮪魚時至, 將取薦宗廟, 因乘舟浮川也.」", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0080_0030", "id": null, "offset": 34, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "潔者, 言陽氣布暢, 萬物訖出, 始潔之矣. 禊者, 潔也, 言自潔濯也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0080_0070", "id": null, "offset": 139, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "蔡邕曰:「今三月上巳, 祓於水濱, 蓋出此也.」", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0130_0010", "id": null, "offset": 180, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "文德七戰七北, 遷延令敵飢疲, 亦同持久之義.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0150_0010", "id": null, "offset": 13, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "胡罪切", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0180_0010", "id": null, "offset": 50, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "今府.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0180_0010", "id": null, "offset": 56, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "今酇縣.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0180_0010", "id": null, "offset": 62, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "今魯郡 金鄕縣.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0180_0010", "id": null, "offset": 67, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "郯音談. 今臨淮郡 下邳縣.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0180_0010", "id": null, "offset": 73, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 5, "text": "今北海郡縣.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0180_0010", "id": null, "offset": 78, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 6, "text": "今天水郡 隴城縣.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0180_0010", "id": null, "offset": 84, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 7, "text": "今太原府.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0180_0010", "id": null, "offset": 89, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 8, "text": "河各反.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0180_0010", "id": null, "offset": 103, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 9, "text": "今范陽郡.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0180_0010", "id": null, "offset": 109, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 10, "text": "今郡縣.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0180_0010", "id": null, "offset": 114, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 11, "text": "今永昌郡.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0180_0010", "id": null, "offset": 120, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 12, "text": "今武陵郡 武陵縣.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0180_0010", "id": null, "offset": 126, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 13, "text": "今蒼梧郡 蒼梧縣.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0180_0010", "id": null, "offset": 161, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 14, "text": "桓帝 永興初, 有鄕三千六百八十二, 亭萬二千四百二十.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0200_0010", "id": null, "offset": 71, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "領郡國十.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0200_0010", "id": null, "offset": 94, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "玄菟·樂浪等郡, 並今遼水之東, 宜在禹貢 靑州之域.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0210_0010", "id": null, "offset": 4, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "今理盧龍縣.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0210_0010", "id": null, "offset": 25, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "今盧龍縣. 有古孤竹城, 伯夷·叔齊之國也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0210_0010", "id": null, "offset": 103, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "漢 肥如縣. 有碣石山, 碣然而立在海旁, 故名之. 晉 太康地志云:「秦築長城, 所起自碣石, 在今高麗舊界, 非此碣石也.」漢 遼西郡故城在今郡東. 又有漢 令支縣城. 臨閭關今名臨楡關, 在縣城東一百八十里. 盧龍塞在城西北二百里.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0220_0010", "id": null, "offset": 31, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "已具注序篇.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0220_0010", "id": null, "offset": 57, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "樂浪本朝鮮國. 漢 元封三年(108), 朝鮮人斬其王而降, 以其地爲樂浪·玄菟等郡, 後又置帶方郡, 並在遼水之東. 浪音郞.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0220_0010", "id": null, "offset": 68, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "領郡國五, 州理於此. 自後漢末公孫度自號平州牧, 及其子康, 康子文懿, 並擅據遼東, 東夷九種皆服事之. 魏置東夷校尉, 居襄平, 而分遼東·昌黎·玄菟· 帶方·樂浪五郡爲平州, 後還合幽州. 及文懿滅後, 有護東校尉居襄平. 晉 咸寧二年(276), 分昌黎·遼東·玄菟·帶方·樂浪等郡國五置平州, 以慕容廆爲刺史, 遂屬永嘉 (307~312)之亂, 爲衆所推. 及其孫儁, 移都於薊. 其後慕容垂子寶, 又遷於和龍. 廆, 胡罪反.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0220_0010", "id": null, "offset": 98, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "今府於遼東城.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0010", "id": null, "offset": 152, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "倭, 烏和反.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0020", "id": null, "offset": 5, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "晉 張華曰: 「朝鮮有泉水·洌水·汕水, 三水合爲洌水, 疑樂浪·朝鮮取名於此也. 汕, 所晏反.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0020", "id": null, "offset": 103, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "秦 遼東郡, 今安東府之東地.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0020", "id": null, "offset": 146, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "浿音滂拜反.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0020", "id": null, "offset": 177, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "魋, 杜回反.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0020", "id": null, "offset": 239, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 5, "text": "在浿水之東.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0020", "id": null, "offset": 401, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 6, "text": "音郞", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0020", "id": null, "offset": 407, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 7, "text": "今悉爲東夷之地.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0030", "id": null, "offset": 23, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "盧奚反.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0030", "id": null, "offset": 406, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "並今東夷之地.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0040", "id": null, "offset": 370, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "魁頭猶科頭也, 謂以髮縈繞成科結也. 紒音計.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0040", "id": null, "offset": 412, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "嚾音喚.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0040", "id": null, "offset": 526, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "蘇塗有似浮屠.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0050", "id": null, "offset": 168, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "皆其官名.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0050", "id": null, "offset": 318, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "扁音補典反.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0060", "id": null, "offset": 145, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "諟音是.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0060", "id": null, "offset": 234, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "屯有·有鹽並漢 遼東屬縣, 並今東夷之地.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0070", "id": null, "offset": 18, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "後魏時百濟王上表云:「臣與高麗先出夫餘.」", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0070", "id": null, "offset": 57, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "今柳城·北平之間.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0070", "id": null, "offset": 203, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "佗典反", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0070", "id": null, "offset": 275, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "鞬音乾.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0070", "id": null, "offset": 772, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 5, "text": "劦音俠.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0070", "id": null, "offset": 786, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 6, "text": "音白", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0080", "id": null, "offset": 45, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "初曰新盧, 宋時曰新羅, 或曰斯羅.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0080", "id": null, "offset": 58, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "亦在高麗東南, 兼有漢時樂浪郡之地.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0080", "id": null, "offset": 285, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "喙, 呼穢反.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0080", "id": null, "offset": 366, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "隋 東蕃風俗記云:「金姓相承三十餘葉」", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0080", "id": null, "offset": 380, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 5, "text": "其王至今亦姓金. 按梁史云姓慕, 未詳中間易姓之由.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0080", "id": null, "offset": 432, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 6, "text": "並三韓之地.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0080", "id": null, "offset": 509, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 7, "text": "咄, 都骨反.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0080", "id": null, "offset": 584, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 8, "text": "郞佐反.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0090", "id": null, "offset": 304, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "魏略云:「倭人自謂太伯之後.」", "type": "원저자주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0090", "id": null, "offset": 584, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "或云邪摩堆", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0090", "id": null, "offset": 1664, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "音饌.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0090", "id": null, "offset": 1924, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "天寶 (742~755)末, 衛尉少卿朝衡卽其國人.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0100", "id": null, "offset": 22, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "按後漢·魏二史皆云: 夫餘國在高句麗北. 又案, 後魏及隋史, 高句麗在夫餘國南. 而隋史云百濟出於夫餘, 夫餘出於高句麗國王子東明之後也. 又謂橐離國卽高麗國, 乃夫餘國當在句麗之南矣. 若詳考諸家所說, 疑槖離在夫餘之北, 別是一國. 然未詳孰是.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0100", "id": null, "offset": 222, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "音其", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0100", "id": null, "offset": 779, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "其居喪, 男女皆純白, 婦人著布面衣, 去環珮, 大體與中國髣髴.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0230_0100", "id": null, "offset": 800, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "廆, 呼罪反.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0240_0010", "id": null, "offset": 767, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "本朱蒙所乘馬種, 卽果下也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0240_0010", "id": null, "offset": 832, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "漢 遼東郡 西安平縣北有小水, 南流入海, 句麗之別種, 依小水作居. 因名之爲小水貊.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0240_0010", "id": null, "offset": 1251, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "𣧑音凶.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0240_0010", "id": null, "offset": 1315, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "在遼東.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0240_0010", "id": null, "offset": 1489, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 5, "text": "音晃", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0240_0010", "id": null, "offset": 1825, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 6, "text": "卽漢 樂浪郡 王險城. 自爲慕容皝來伐, 後徙國內城, 移都此城.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0240_0010", "id": null, "offset": 1924, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 7, "text": "其地後漢時方二千里. 至魏南北漸狹, 纔千餘里. 至隋漸大, 東西六千里.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0240_0010", "id": null, "offset": 2550, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 8, "text": "昨沒反.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0240_0010", "id": null, "offset": 2575, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 9, "text": "之悅反.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0240_0010", "id": null, "offset": 2759, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 10, "text": "內屋反", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0240_0010", "id": null, "offset": 2976, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 11, "text": "按尙書云:「夾右碣石入於河.」右碣石卽河赴海處, 在今北平郡南二十餘里, 則高麗中爲左碣石.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0240_0010", "id": null, "offset": 3077, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 12, "text": "則移反", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0240_0010", "id": null, "offset": 3228, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 13, "text": "漢 樂浪·玄菟郡之地, 自後漢及魏, 爲公孫氏所據. 至淵滅, 西晉 永嘉 (307~312)以後, 復陷入高麗. 其不耐·屯有·帶方·安市·平郭·安平·居就·文城皆漢二郡諸縣, 則朝鮮·濊貊·沃沮之地.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0240_0010", "id": null, "offset": 3300, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 14, "text": "其王元在位十八年, 高武卽元異母弟.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0240_0010", "id": null, "offset": 5097, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 15, "text": "音衛", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0240_0020", "id": null, "offset": 142, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "蓋音合.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0240_0020", "id": null, "offset": 327, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "鎗也, 音歷.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0240_0020", "id": null, "offset": 388, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "大加, 句麗官號, 所謂有馬·牛·羊·狗加,", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0240_0030", "id": null, "offset": 38, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "楛音戶.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0240_0030", "id": null, "offset": 199, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "所謂挹婁貂是也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0250_0010", "id": null, "offset": 191, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "音撥", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0250_0010", "id": null, "offset": 239, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "杜環 經行記云:「其國城一名赭支, 一名大宛. 天寶 (742~755)中, 鎭西節度使高仙芝擒其王及妻子歸京師. …… 其川西頭有城, 名曰怛邏斯, 石國人鎭, 卽天寶十年(751) 高仙芝軍敗之地.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0270_0010", "id": null, "offset": 49, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "歠, 昌悅反.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0270_0010", "id": null, "offset": 59, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "今馬邑郡界.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0270_0020", "id": null, "offset": 188, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "可汗之號始於此.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0300_0010", "id": null, "offset": 53, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "和龍今柳城郡.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0300_0010", "id": null, "offset": 137, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "密雲今郡.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_041_ko_041_0320_0010", "id": null, "offset": 37, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "錦按: 各本均作「細」, 後漢書 東夷列傳作「長」.", "type": "원주"}
